OL,3,A'He's a killer': Zelensky reacts to
OL,4,ATrump calling Putin a friend
OL,5,
OL,6,FUkraine's president Volodymyr Zelensky
OL,7,Fhas labelled Vladimir Putin as a
OL,8,F"killer" in response to Donald Trump
OL,9,Freferring to the Russian leader as his
OL,10,F"friend" following their meeting in
OL,11,FChina this week.
OL,13,FSpeaking to CNN, Zelensky said it was
OL,14,Fup to the US president "how to call
OL,15,FPutin" but "for us, he is an enemy...
OL,16,Ffor us, he's a killer".
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
