OL,3,A'He's a killer': Zelensky reacts to
OL,4,ATrump calling Putin a friend
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn the sidelines of a historic
OL,7,Ftrilateral meeting with Chinese leader
OL,8,FXi Jinping and Putin on Thursday, Trump
OL,9,Fcalled Putin his "friend" and said the
OL,10,Ftwo leaders have had a "great
OL,11,Frelationship for many years".
OL,13,FAt least nine people were killed in
OL,14,FRussian attacks targeting bridges in
OL,15,FKyiv and railway stations on Friday,
OL,16,Fdays after Ukraine badly damaged the
OL,17,FCrimean Bridge.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
